   "updated_at": "2026-11-07T15:35:30Z",
   "body": "**Operator feedback after a device test (2026-11-07), M4:**\n- the account button at the top right should show the **active account's avatar**, not an empty icon;\n- when the menu is open, each account should show its **name and avatar**, or a default avatar when it has none.\n\nThis adds the menu rows to this issue's scope. The avatar comes from the account's own profile, which LOT-116 and `AccountServices` already fetch. Use a default image or the #569 monogram when none.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
